a's aviation authority investigates the event.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Is Germany's economic slump finally over?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:9769b006eb4b6354a49987471ab6545625bcac19120fd0af338ffae3de15ed6b</id><updated>2026-09-03T12:55:19Z</updated><published>2026-09-03T12:30:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/is-germany-s-economic-slump-finally-over/a-78815447--95acbfe46f77.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/is-germany-s-economic-slump-finally-over/a-78815447?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Despite a slew of negative headlines, the German economy has posted its best figures in years. There are reasons for optimism but structural issues remain.</summary><category term="Business" /></entry><entry><title>Malaysia's middle path between China and US faces new tests</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e3052e7b132a6a201e9397c16e72747373dff21b4e4f881f893e7a8fd0a305e7</id><updated>2026-09-03T12:55:22Z</updated><published>2026-09-03T12:00:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/malaysia-s-middle-path-between-china-and-us-faces-new-tests/a-78865212--dea46f61380d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/malaysia-s-middle-path-between-china-and-us-faces-new-tests/a-78865212?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The prime minister's comments on Taiwan and US-backed military facilities near Sabah have revived questions over Malaysia's non-aligned foreign policy.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Iran bets on shadow networks to evade US sanctions</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:5caa8070270415368f58fa3bd626f25e76557022a57c54850bf5265d62628976</id><updated>2026-09-03T12:55:26Z</updated><published>2026-09-03T11:59:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/iran-bets-on-shadow-networks-to-evade-us-sanctions/a-78863283--3c3e4a5c1925.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/iran-bets-on-shadow-networks-to-evade-us-sanctions/a-78863283?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">To circumvent US sanctions, Iran has spent decades building a complex network of businesspeople and companies. A billionaire once sentenced to death is now back at its center.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>India news: Jaishankar offers help to end war in Ukraine</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:bcd6bd7a13f5b310cdb858555fc903d4eac833ece38a7a3bf56d5f99f94816a4</id><updated>2026-09-03T12:55:28Z</updated><published>2026-09-03T11:33:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/india-news-jaishankar-offers-help-to-end-war-in-ukraine/live-78815659--b74d6f775fcf.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/india-news-jaishankar-offers-help-to-end-war-in-ukraine/live-78815659?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Foreign Minister S. Jaishankar says India is prepared to assist efforts to end the war in Ukraine, as the foreign minister visits Kyiv. DW has more.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Gloria Steinem, feminist activist and journalist, dies at 92</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:caf037e2d125f188e6fc9c263ddcf03296454e1d11ec31de5d2211db6a5e49a0</id><updated>2026-09-03T12:55:31Z</updated><published>2026-09-03T10:28:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/gloria-steinem-feminist-activist-and-journalist-dies-at-92/a-78855039--0f5631bbb8e3.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/gloria-steinem-feminist-activist-and-journalist-dies-at-92/a-78855039?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Steinem became a prominent leader of the second wave of the feminist movement in the US.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>'Supersized' El Nino could be strongest on record, UN says</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:ae7ce3d063605c7f64671a82cbf0b8bdaf6f1a139f09a7c4defa168b9b68c5aa</id><updated>2026-09-03T12:55:34Z</updated><published>2026-09-03T09:39:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/supersized-el-nino-could-be-strongest-on-record-un-says/a-78841246--1ae35f02a59e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/supersized-el-nino-could-be-strongest-on-record-un-says/a-78841246?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The current El Nino could end up being the strongest since records began 40 years ago, the UN warns. It says the phenomenon is being "supersized" thanks to exceptionally warm temperatures in the tropical Pacific Ocean.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Data centers are everywhere. Here's what they're doing to the planet.</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:545e64bf7c845764c60cf71872af51901abdea19be035441da7193a72f232e1c</id><updated>2026-09-03T12:55:38Z</updated><published>2026-09-03T08:53:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/data-centers-are-everywhere-here-s-what-they-re-doing-to-the-planet/a-78789889--c90a71f162f9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/data-centers-are-everywhere-here-s-what-they-re-doing-to-the-planet/a-78789889?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">As data centers multiply to meet AI demand, they're straining power grids, draining water supplies, and reshaping the land and air around them.</summary><category term="Environment" /></entry><entry><title>Germany news: Police say arson attack targeted defense firm</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:2d2912f9725405b3e9411dccd1fc3d7deaf9f944add7ed808662b706b7e4305b</id><updated>2026-09-03T12:55:40Z</updated><published>2026-09-03T07:34:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-news-police-say-arson-attack-targeted-defense-firm/live-78818089--9ab675e17ffe.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-news-police-say-arson-attack-targeted-defense-firm/live-78818089?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Two people were arrested in connection with a small fire at a construction site near a technology and defense company in Munich. Investigators are looking at a possible "political motive." More on DW.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>US, Australia to boost defense ties amid China's growing influence</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:ab86e5c804e578c9f562a955b19bce77fd041c5575e4bf9413219e46f8c27e0b</id><updated>2026-09-03T12:55:43Z</updated><published>2026-09-03T07:09:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/us-australia-to-boost-defense-ties-amid-china-s-growing-influence/a-78815760--2e94abd96401.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/us-australia-to-boost-defense-ties-amid-china-s-growing-influence/a-78815760?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The two countries said they had agreed to speed up cooperation and boost US military presence in Australia to counter China's unprecedented military buildup.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>US: New York City Mayor Mamdani announces ban on AI for younger students</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:2fb01c48c9d069d6679ecf50a228aa7a1445c6cfc0a3b9245741e82ac8b7f008</id><updated>2026-09-03T12:55:46Z</updated><published>2026-09-03T06:28:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/us-new-york-city-mayor-mamdani-announces-ban-on-ai-for-younger-students/a-78815448--e261eae34df5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/us-new-york-city-mayor-mamdani-announces-ban-on-ai-for-younger-students/a-78815448?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">New York City is barring elementary and middle school students from using generative AI tools this school year. Meanwhile AI literacy classes and supervised pilot programs will be rolled out for high schoolers.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Russia to close branches of Germany's Goethe-Institut</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:8c6f2a7b7c0ee0556efe39dd834c3456a15c77096fc160a00859a8f1ff60d6cf</id><updated>2026-09-03T12:53:33Z</updated><published>2026-09-03T03:44:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/russia-to-close-branches-of-germany-s-goethe-institut/a-78815269--63dcf66c3fe5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/russia-to-close-branches-of-germany-s-goethe-institut/a-78815269?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Russian Foreign Minister Sergey Lavrov said the move was in response to Germany's decision to close the Russian House in Berlin after blaming Moscow for an attemped drone attack at Leipzig/Halle Airport.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>US: 3 dead including suspect in Minneapolis shooting</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:f6b9796d5164bc5dec0a1a3998c1441d645b4c41aac2527826247fba059cdbd5</id><updated>2026-09-03T12:53:33Z</updated><published>2026-09-03T00:45:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/us-3-dead-including-suspect-in-minneapolis-shooting/a-78815092--3b3d7caa6a4c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/us-3-dead-including-suspect-in-minneapolis-shooting/a-78815092?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The motive for the shooting is still unclear. Local authorities and the FBI are responding to the incident.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>UNICEF: 1 in 5 youths targeted by online sexual abuse</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:dd9717a472a7b6e99b7edc151ec15134054387d790b8509c8c7e664af5a269b0</id><updated>2026-09-03T12:53:33Z</updated><published>2026-09-03T00:05:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/unicef-1-in-5-youths-targeted-by-online-sexual-abuse/a-78654173--bfc3fe09dc38.html" t